OL,3,GNEWSA'Massive loss' if hotel becomes
OL,4,Aprivate home
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe possibility of a luxury hotel
OL,7,Fbecoming a private home would be "a
OL,8,Fmassive loss" to the island, according
OL,9,Fto the constable of St Martin, Karen
OL,10,FShenton Stone.
OL,12,FThe owners of Chateau La Chaire are
OL,13,Fseeking permission to turn it into a
OL,14,Fresidential property, external.
OL,16,FThe Grade II listed hotel , externalhas
OL,17,Fbeen on the market since November but
OL,18,Fhas yet to find a buyer.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
